*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  verification of CB007873-H feature in the case of FDD+TDD Classical L1Bypass SA
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : Reach a cell setup state, and perfom basic tests : 
...                       Ue Register, UL or/& DL traffic, ...                
